{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenges contain two images composed of eyes: one defined on the right and one interactive on the left. In the center, a series of rules will change the color and shape of the eyes in the left image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to compose the left image so that it is identical to the right one once the changes are applied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also another option where both images are defined, and it's up to you to create the change rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred challenges to solve across 10 difficulty levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing atmosphere (or not if you're trypophobic!)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119120?t=1767624934","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119120/5d26baf70fed9e673c7c17e22f89469c27c8b5b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767624934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119120/92d49ac84ff3dc1c50dc850d491b99bb671a907a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767624934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119120/92d49ac84ff3dc1c50dc850d491b99bb671a907a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767624934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4253050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenges contain two images composed of eyes: one defined on the right and one interactive on the left. In the center, a series of rules will change the color and shape of the eyes in the left image.